
# flux materials (0.9.0)
item.fluxecho.flux_grit.name=Flux Grit
fluxecho.flux_grit.tip=§3Dust that falls off the deep layer's shards while a collector condenses ores§r\nOnly the Flux Shard Collector gives it off\nGrows into flux crystal in GT's autoclave with ender pearl dust and distilled water
item.fluxecho.flux_crystal.name=Flux Crystal
fluxecho.flux_crystal.tip=§3The first matter the flux layer takes on in the real world§r\nThe Flux Nexus's frame, conduits and core are made of it
item.fluxecho.echo_crystal.name=Echo Crystal
fluxecho.echo_crystal.holds=§dHolds: %s · %s
fluxecho.echo_crystal.tip=§3A flux crystal the Flux Nexus pressed one Echo Codex entry into§r\nThe entry itself is kept; the same entry can be pressed once a day\nResearch, modules and the Echo Library take it
item.fluxecho.phase_alloy.name=Phase Alloy
fluxecho.phase_alloy.tip=§3Titanium smelted with flux crystals and an echo crystal: deep blue metal with the flux layer's phase running slowly through it§r\nMade in GT's electric blast furnace (EV, 2700 K)\nPhase II of the nexus and the modules of the phase take it; GT's wiremill draws it into the wire of memory filament
item.fluxecho.resonant_glass.name=Resonant Glass
fluxecho.resonant_glass.tip=§3Borosilicate glass the nexus tuned with phase alloy: clear, its edge rippling cyan when machines near it run§r\nManifested at the Flux Nexus once Phase II is researched\nThe Echo Dome Generator and the Tidal Well take it, the resonant windows later
item.fluxecho.phase_alloy_wire.name=Phase Alloy Wire
fluxecho.phase_alloy_wire.tip=§3Phase alloy drawn as fine as a hair§r\nDrawn in GT's wiremill (IV), eight to an ingot\nCoated with an echo crystal at the Flux Nexus it becomes memory filament
item.fluxecho.memory_filament.name=Memory Filament
fluxecho.memory_filament.tip=§3Phase alloy wire coated with an echo crystal: a fine filament glowing like a string of light, holding what flowed through it§r\nManifested at the Flux Nexus from the wiremill's phase alloy wire once Phase II is researched\nPhase III of the nexus, the outer ring and the phase's buildings take it
item.fluxecho.manifest_matter.name=Manifest Matter
fluxecho.manifest_matter.tip=§3A little of the flux layer made matter: black-gold liquid metal that never stops slowly changing shape§r\nManifested at a Flux Nexus of phase III or later from phase alloy, an echo crystal and an LuV circuit once the Sophon Array is researched; the table draws a great deal of power while it makes it\nPhase IV of the nexus, the sky ring, the anti-gravity lattice and the phase's buildings take it
item.fluxecho.anti_gravity_lattice.name=Anti-gravity Lattice
fluxecho.anti_gravity_lattice.tip=§3A lattice cube that hangs in the air, a lifting light under it§r\nManifested at the Flux Nexus from manifest matter and resonant glass once the Sky Ring is researched\nThe floating foundations of the sky ring's platforms and the sky ring's buildings take it
